* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
preloaded-classes text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
# zygote_exec is an aarch64 ELF, not a script. Marking it "text" let git apply
# end-of-line conversion to it (a CRLF checkout on Windows, or a commit from
# one, would rewrite 0x0d 0x0a byte pairs and corrupt the binary).
zygote_exec binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.img binary
*.so binary
7zz binary
